WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.344
Wukong and his companions walked on the mountain road.

2
00:00:06.345 --> 00:00:10.863
The monkey watched carefully for the monster and demons.

3
00:00:10.864 --> 00:00:16.845
Suddenly a demon charged toward the group.

4
00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:19.586
[g@"Stay here, everyone!" shouted Bajie.

5
00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:22.992
"I'll fight this demon!"@g]

6
00:00:22.993 --> 00:00:25.609
The pig swung his rake.

7
00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:30.946
The demon stepped off the road and headed down the slope of the mountain.

8
00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:35.918
Bajie raced after the demon and was soon out of sight.

9
00:00:35.919 --> 00:00:39.915
[g@Wukong heard grunts and clashing weapons.

10
00:00:39.916 --> 00:00:42.663
But he couldn't see the fight.@g]

11
00:00:42.664 --> 00:00:48.833
A moment later the demon climbed back onto the road.

12
00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:51.535
[g@"Stay here, Wujing!" shouted Wukong.

13
00:00:51.536 --> 00:00:54.033
"Protect the Tang Monk!"@g]

14
00:00:54.034 --> 00:00:57.027
[g@The monkey charged toward the demon.

15
00:00:57.028 --> 00:01:00.519
[i@Clang!@i] Their weapons clashed.@g]

16
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:05.033
Wukong fought with all his strength.

17
00:01:05.034 --> 00:01:08.852
[g@Again the demon left the road and headed down the mountain.

18
00:01:08.853 --> 00:01:10.925
Wukong chased him.@g]

19
00:01:10.926 --> 00:01:15.595
The monkey and the demon disappeared down the slope of the mountain.

20
00:01:15.596 --> 00:01:20.331
"Do you think Wukong can defeat that demon?" asked the Tang Monk nervously.

21
00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:22.729
"Definitely," said Wujing.

22
00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.138
[g@"I wonder what happened to Bajie though.

23
00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:28.401
I hope he's okay."@g]

24
00:01:28.402 --> 00:01:31.436
Suddenly the demon was back.

25
00:01:31.437 --> 00:01:33.033
[g@Wujing was shocked.

26
00:01:33.034 --> 00:01:35.554
"How did you get past Wukong?"@g]

27
00:01:35.555 --> 00:01:40.884
Without waiting for an answer, Wujing raised his spear and attacked the demon.

28
00:01:40.885 --> 00:01:44.445
The two fought, kicking up dust and rocks.

29
00:01:44.446 --> 00:01:47.728
Wujing struck the demon across the legs.

30
00:01:47.729 --> 00:01:50.951
[g@The demon tumbled down the mountainside.

31
00:01:50.952 --> 00:01:53.376
Wujing ran after him.@g]

32
00:01:53.377 --> 00:01:56.197
[g@The Tang Monk stood in the road.

33
00:01:56.198 --> 00:01:59.312
For a moment everything was quiet.@g]

34
00:01:59.313 --> 00:02:02.138
Then he heard footsteps behind him.

35
00:02:02.139 --> 00:02:05.846
The monk turned around and gasped.

36
00:02:05.847 --> 00:02:11.795
A huge, fat monster was smiling wickedly at him.

37
00:02:11.796 --> 00:02:16.709
When Wukong returned to the road, he found Bajie alone.

38
00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.287
The pig looked upset.

39
00:02:19.288 --> 00:02:23.052
"Where are Master and Wujing?" asked the monkey.

40
00:02:23.053 --> 00:02:25.404
[g@Bajie scratched his head.

41
00:02:25.405 --> 00:02:26.772
"I don't know.@g]

42
00:02:26.773 --> 00:02:30.102
[g@I defeated that demon and then came back here.

43
00:02:30.103 --> 00:02:33.406
Everyone was gone."@g]

44
00:02:33.407 --> 00:02:36.815
"You didn't defeat the demon," said Wukong.

45
00:02:36.816 --> 00:02:38.672
[g@"He got past you.

46
00:02:38.673 --> 00:02:42.030
He came back here, and I had to fight him."@g]

47
00:02:42.031 --> 00:02:45.957
"What!" shouted Bajie. "You're crazy!

48
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:49.922
I was fighting with the demon until just a few moments ago!"

49
00:02:49.923 --> 00:02:51.932
[g@Wukong scoffed.

50
00:02:51.933 --> 00:02:54.947
"Do you really expect me to believe that?@g]

51
00:02:54.948 --> 00:02:58.071
[i@I@i] was just fighting with the demon!"

52
00:02:58.072 --> 00:03:01.785
Wujing returned to the road, annoyed.

53
00:03:01.786 --> 00:03:04.138
[g@"How did that demon get past you two?

54
00:03:04.139 --> 00:03:06.411
He wasn't that powerful."@g]

55
00:03:06.412 --> 00:03:08.858
[g@Wukong was confused.

56
00:03:08.859 --> 00:03:11.274
"The demon didn't get past me.@g]

57
00:03:11.275 --> 00:03:14.937
I was fighting with him until just a moment ago."

58
00:03:14.938 --> 00:03:17.711
"That's impossible," said Wujing.

59
00:03:17.712 --> 00:03:22.148
[g@"After you chased him down the slope, he returned and—

60
00:03:22.149 --> 00:03:24.639
Where's Master?"@g]

61
00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.648
Wukong made a fist.

62
00:03:26.649 --> 00:03:29.273
[g@"How could we be so stupid?

63
00:03:29.274 --> 00:03:31.573
There wasn't just one demon.@g]

64
00:03:31.574 --> 00:03:33.459
[g@There were three!

65
00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:36.519
They lured us away, one by one.@g]

66
00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:42.564
Then another demon—probably that fat monster— grabbed Master while we were gone."

67
00:03:42.565 --> 00:03:45.798
Bajie fumed. "You're right!"

68
00:03:45.799 --> 00:03:49.383
[g@"That monster must have a cave nearby," said Wujing.

69
00:03:49.384 --> 00:03:51.117
"Let's find it."@g]

70
00:03:51.118 --> 00:03:56.525
The three companions searched the mountain.

71
00:03:56.526 --> 00:03:58.449
[g@They soon found a cave.

72
00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.947
Its door was shut.@g]

73
00:04:00.948 --> 00:04:04.521
"Do you think this is the monster's cave?" asked Wujing.

74
00:04:04.522 --> 00:04:07.280
"We'll find out," said Bajie.

75
00:04:07.281 --> 00:04:11.259
He raised his rake and knocked a hole in the door.

76
00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:17.046
Then he shouted into the hole, "Release the Tang Monk!"

77
00:04:17.047 --> 00:04:21.462
A demon inside the cave shrieked and ran into a kitchen.

78
00:04:21.463 --> 00:04:25.400
The monster was grinding spices with a mortar and pestle.

79
00:04:25.401 --> 00:04:28.470
"That pig is here!" cried the demon.

80
00:04:28.471 --> 00:04:30.944
[g@The monster kept grinding.

81
00:04:30.945 --> 00:04:35.338
"Who cares? I'm only afraid of Wukong."@g]

82
00:04:35.339 --> 00:04:39.366
"I'm here too!" shouted Wukong through the hole.

83
00:04:39.367 --> 00:04:44.447
The monster dropped the mortar and pestle. "Uh-oh."

84
00:04:44.448 --> 00:04:46.813
He thought for a moment.

85
00:04:46.814 --> 00:04:51.348
Then he cleared his throat and shouted, "You're too late!

86
00:04:51.349 --> 00:04:58.702
We already ate the Tang Monk!"

